<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Singapore stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore share market is closed on Friday for the Good Friday holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday, March 31.</p>
<p>The key Straits Times Industrials Index closed weaker on Thursday, down 12.68 points at 2,098.92.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
